OL,3,GNEWSAPolice make arrest in rape        
OL,4,Ainvestigation                          
OL,6,FPolice investigating the rape of a     
OL,7,Fwoman near a rail line in              
OL,8,FNottinghamshire have made an arrest.   
OL,10,FOfficers were called to Clay Lane,     
OL,11,FNewark, after the woman was attacked at
OL,12,Fabout 15:00 GMT on 18 November.        
OL,14,FNottinghamshire Police said a man was  
OL,15,Farrested on suspicion of rape on Monday
OL,16,Fand had been bailed with strict        
OL,17,Fconditions.                            
OL,19,FThe force added the woman was still    
OL,20,Fbeing supported by specially trained   
OL,21,Fofficers.                              
